# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# Persistent simulations on a GPU (D196), scenario energies-mixed of
# Inputs/python_segments.py.
# The energies of a final step of energy against the rows
# of `mdir run`, NVE, NVT, and NPT in mixed precision.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_segments.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU mdir %t energies-mixed | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: energies NPT Mixed: the rows of mdir run at steps 10 and 20 to every printed digit, in one part and in two
# CHECK: segments energies-mixed passed
